%%{init: {"theme": "base", "themeVariables": {"fontSize": "18px"}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    participant C as 👤 Cliente
    participant AC as 🎮 AuthController
    participant AS as 🔐 AuthService
    participant PR as 🗄️ PrismaService
    participant JWT as 🏷️ JwtService
    participant DB as 🐘 PostgreSQL

    Note over C,DB: FLUJO DE LOGIN

    C->>AC: POST /auth/login {email, password}
    AC->>AS: login(dto)
    AS->>PR: user.findUnique(email)
    PR->>DB: SELECT * FROM user WHERE email=?
    DB-->>PR: User | null
    PR-->>AS: User
    alt Usuario no existe
        AS-->>C: 401 "Credenciales inválidas"
    end
    AS->>AS: bcrypt.compare(password, hash)
    alt Contraseña incorrecta
        AS-->>C: 401 "Credenciales inválidas"
    end
    AS->>JWT: sign(payload, {expiresIn: 15m})
    JWT-->>AS: accessToken
    AS->>AS: crypto.randomBytes(64)
    AS->>AS: sha256(refreshToken) → tokenHash
    AS->>PR: refreshToken.create({tokenHash, userId, expiresAt})
    PR->>DB: INSERT INTO refresh_token
    DB-->>PR: RefreshToken
    PR-->>AS: RefreshToken
    AS-->>C: {accessToken, refreshToken, user}

    Note over C,DB: FLUJO DE REFRESH

    C->>AC: POST /auth/refresh {refreshToken}
    AC->>AS: refresh(refreshToken)
    AS->>AS: sha256(refreshToken)
    AS->>PR: refreshToken.findFirst(hash, not revoked, not expired)
    PR->>DB: SELECT * FROM refresh_token WHERE ...
    DB-->>PR: RefreshToken | null
    alt Token inválido o expirado
        AS-->>C: 401 "Refresh token inválido"
    end
    AS->>PR: refreshToken.update(revokedAt: now)
    PR->>DB: UPDATE refresh_token SET revokedAt=now
    AS->>JWT: sign(new payload)
    JWT-->>AS: newAccessToken
    AS->>AS: newRefreshToken + sha256 hash
    AS->>PR: refreshToken.create(newHash)
    PR->>DB: INSERT new_refresh_token
    AS-->>C: {newAccessToken, newRefreshToken}

    Note over C,DB: FLUJO DE LOGOUT

    C->>AC: POST /auth/logout {refreshToken} + JWT
    AC->>AS: logout(refreshToken)
    AS->>AS: sha256(refreshToken)
    AS->>PR: refreshToken.updateMany(revokedAt: now)
    PR->>DB: UPDATE refresh_token SET revokedAt=now WHERE hash=?
    AS-->>C: "Logged out successfully"